2:T76c,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much do kitchen makeovers on a budget near me cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"There is no single reliable price because room size, materials, layout changes and labour vary. Ask for a detailed, itemised quote based on your kitchen rather than relying on a generic figure. BMB Renovation offers free, no-obligation quotes, and every project differs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the cheapest way to update a kitchen?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Keeping the existing layout and sound cabinet units can reduce costs. Painting, replacing handles, improving lighting, changing the worktop or updating flooring may refresh the room without a full replacement."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is it cheaper to buy a kitchen and arrange fitting separately?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not always. Compare the complete supply-and-fit cost, including preparation, connections, waste removal and finishing work. A cheaper product price may involve more installation or coordination costs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I keep my existing kitchen cabinets during a makeover?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, if the cabinet boxes are structurally sound, the layout works and the units can accept the chosen doors or fittings. A contractor should inspect their condition before you commit to reusing them."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can I find a kitchen renovation company near Watford?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Look for a company that clearly lists its service area, installation scope and quotation process. BMB Renovation is based in Watford, offers free, no-obligation quotes and serves Watford, Bushey, Rickmansworth, St Albans, Hemel Hempstead, Borehamwood, Harrow, Croxley Green, Luton and Bedford."}}]}7:["slug","kitchen-makeovers-on-a-budget-near-me","d"]
